{"id": "r20-slovo", "title": "The family of слово", "blocks": [{"t": "lead", "text": "The family of слово"}, {"t": "h", "text": "Where слово comes from"}, {"t": "p", "text": "Inherited from Old East Slavic слово, from Proto-Slavic *slȍvo (“word”)."}, {"t": "note", "text": "Wiktionary, «слово», Etymology (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/слово#Russian)."}, {"t": "h", "text": "The family"}, {"t": "table", "head": ["Word", "Part of speech", "Made of (Wiktionary's etymology)", "Meaning (Wiktionary)"], "rows": [["**слово**", "noun", "—", "word, term; speech, address"], ["**усло́вие**", "noun", "у- + сло́во + -ие", "condition; term, stipulation, proviso"], ["**посло́вица**", "noun", "—", "proverb, saying, adage (communicating a lesson or important truth)"], ["**слове́сность**", "noun", "слове́сный + -ость", "literature; lore, folklore"], ["**предисло́вие**", "noun", "преди- + сло́в(о) + -ие", "prologue, foreword, preface, introduction"], ["**слове́чко**", "noun", "словцо́ + -ко", "word"], ["**слове́сный**", "adjective", "—", "verbal, oral; philological"], ["**словарь**", "noun", "сло́во + -а́рь", "dictionary, wordbook; vocabulary, glossary"], ["**родосло́вный**", "adjective", "родословие + -ный", "(relational) genealogy"], ["**словеса́**", "noun", "—", "(ironic, or, literary) words, text, verbiage"], ["**словцо́**", "noun", "сло́во + -цо́", "word"]], "rowHeads": false}, {"t": "note", "text": "The words the Russian Wiktionary lists as related to «слово» (its «Родственные слова», https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/слово), common ones only; part of speech, make-up and meaning from the English Wiktionary."}], "exercises": []}